===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc}} {{term|εἴκοσι||twenty|tr=eikosi|lang=grc|script=polytonic}} + {{term|sc=polytonic|εἶδος|tr=eidos||form, likeness}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{biochemistry}} Any of a [[family]] of [[naturally-occurring]] [[substance]]s derived fro 20-[[carbon]] [[polyunsaturated fatty acid]]s; they include the [[prostaglandin]]s, [[thromboxane]]s, [[leukotriene]]s and [[epoxyeicosatrienoic acid]]s; they [[function]] as [[hormone]]s.

